# The 2026-08-17 whole-feeder run is an archival record: it is stored exactly as AIMMS
# wrote it, CRLF and all. core.autocrlf would otherwise strip one byte per line from the
# blob, so what the repository holds would no longer be what the machine produced.
# -text (rather than binary) keeps these diffable.
results/full_feeder_2026-08/*.csv -text
results/full_feeder_2026-08/*.txt -text
